## What is here

```
code/       numbered scripts in run order (01_fetch -> 02_build -> 03_qa -> 04_figures)
data/raw/   inputs as fetched, with PROVENANCE.txt
data/processed/  outputs, with qa_report.txt and stats.json
docs/       CODEBOOK, LIMITATIONS, VERIFY_CHECKLIST, NEXT_STEPS
tests/      offline pytest suite
```

## Run it

```
pip install -e ".[dev]"
python code/01_fetch.py
python code/02_build.py
python code/03_qa.py
python code/04_figures.py
pytest -q
```

A stranger should be able to run these from this README alone and reproduce `data/processed/` exactly.

