## Built with reproflow

This project follows the reproducible-engineering framework in
[reproflow](https://github.com/foikwuogu/reproflow): packaging via
`pyproject.toml`, an offline pytest suite, a CI workflow that runs it,
provenance logging for every fetch, and a publish gate
(`reproflow gate check .`) that scans for draft stamps, unresolved
verify-tags, placeholders, and secrets before release.
